
## .gitignore

Save this as `.gitignore` in your project root.

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environment
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Pytest
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local env files
.env
.env.*

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
